{"detail":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"ko\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src https://daesan.ai https://*.daesan.ai https://cafe24img.com https://*.cafe24img.com https://www.kccworld.co.kr/assets/images/ho/bm/img_hb_mark.jpg; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'\"><meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\"><style>@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:400;src:url(fonts/400) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:500;src:url(fonts/500) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:600;src:url(fonts/600) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:700;src:url(fonts/700) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:800;src:url(fonts/800) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}html,body{margin:0;padding:0}body{display:flow-root;font:12px/1.5 Pretendard,sans-serif;color:#353535}p,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,ul,ol,li,dl,dt,dd,figure{margin:0;padding:0}table{width:100%;border:0;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse}img{border:0;vertical-align:top;max-width:100%}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}#cafe24-detail{max-width:790px;margin:auto}@media(min-width:701px){#cafe24-detail h3.ds-block-title{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 20px}}@media(max-width:700px){body{font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;color:#1b1b1b}td,th{line-height:18px}#cafe24-detail{width:95.25%}}</style><style></style></head><body><div id=\"cafe24-detail\"><h2 class=\"sectionTitleH2\" style=\"margin: 18px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;font-family: Oswald, sans-serif;font-size: 5.2rem;font-weight: 600;letter-spacing: -0.02em;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);line-height: 1.15;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial\">차음시트 2T</h2><p class=\"font-28\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;font-size: 20px;font-weight: 800;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: Heebo, Pretendard, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: Heebo, Pretendard, sans-serif;font-size: 22px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 800;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;float: none;display: inline !important\">Plastic Damping Sheet</span></p><div class=\"option block\" style=\"margin: 18px 0px 0px;padding: 20px 0px;max-width: 645px;border-top: 1px solid rgb(102, 102, 102);border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(224, 224, 224);color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: Heebo, Pretendard, sans-serif;font-size: 13px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial\"><h6 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px;padding: 0px;font-size: 16px;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(34, 34, 34)\">상품 사양</h6><dl style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 12px 0px;display: flex;align-items: flex-start;gap: 10px;border-top: 0px;font-size: 15px\"><dt style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;width: 140px;flex-shrink: 0;display: flex;align-items: center;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);line-height: 1.4\"><i class=\"xi-check-circle-o\" style=\"font-size: 16px;margin-right: 6px;font-family: xeicon !important\"></i>제조(원산지)</dt><dd style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;flex: 1 1 0%;font-weight: 400;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);line-height: 1.5;word-break: keep-all\">OEM(중국산)</dd></dl><dl style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 12px 0px;display: flex;align-items: flex-start;gap: 10px;border-top: 1px solid rgb(240, 240, 240);font-size: 15px\"><dt style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;width: 140px;flex-shrink: 0;display: flex;align-items: center;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);line-height: 1.4\"><i class=\"xi-check-circle-o\" style=\"font-size: 16px;margin-right: 6px;font-family: xeicon !important\"></i>무게</dt><dd style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;flex: 1 1 0%;font-weight: 400;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);line-height: 1.5;word-break: keep-all\">3.5kg(2T)</dd></dl><dl style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 12px 0px;display: flex;align-items: flex-start;gap: 10px;border-top: 1px solid rgb(240, 240, 240);font-size: 15px\"><dt style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;width: 140px;flex-shrink: 0;display: flex;align-items: center;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);line-height: 1.4\"><i class=\"xi-check-circle-o\" style=\"font-size: 16px;margin-right: 6px;font-family: xeicon !important\"></i>두께</dt><dd style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;flex: 1 1 0%;font-weight: 400;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);line-height: 1.5;word-break: keep-all\">1T,2T,3T,4T</dd></dl></div><div class=\"textBox block\" style=\"margin: 18px 0px 0px;padding: 20px 0px;max-width: 645px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 1.65;font-family: Heebo, Pretendard, sans-serif;font-size: 13px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial\"><h6 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px;padding: 0px;font-size: 16px;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(34, 34, 34)\">상품 설명</h6><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;padding: 0px;font-size: 15px;color: rgb(85, 85, 85)\">차음시트는 고체음과 공기전파음 차단 성능이 우수한 고성능 제진형 차음재로, 다양한 건축 구조물에 적용 가능하며 저두께 설계로 공간 손실을 최소화할 수 있습니다. 외부에서 유입되는 습기를 효과적으로 차단하고 방염성이 뛰어나 석고보드 등 판형 자재와 병행 시공 시 난연성과 차음 성능을 동시에 높일 수 있습니다. 또한 일반 커터칼로 손쉽게 재단이 가능하며, 한쪽 면 접착 처리로 시공 편의성이 뛰어나 작업 효율을 높여줍니다.</p><h6 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px;padding: 0px;font-size: 16px;font-weight: 700;color: rgb(34, 34, 34)\">특이사항</h6><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;padding: 0px;font-size: 15px;color: rgb(85, 85, 85)\">면밀도가 높은 고무 소재를 적용해 소음 감소 및 차음 성능이 뛰어나며, 외부에서 유입되는 습기를 효과적으로 차단합니다. 한쪽 면 점착 처리로 별도의 접착 작업 없이 간편하게 시공할 수 있어 작업성이 우수합니다. 또한 진동 전달을 억제하는 제진 기능을 통해 구조물에 가해지는 충격음을 효과적으로 감소시켜 보다 안정적인 차음 환경을 구현합니다.</p></div><br /></div></body></html>","additional":[],"unconfirmed":false}